In this work, we introduce \package{}, a novel interactive tool for AI developers, designed to reduce the overhead of manual error analysis.
Our approach utilizes an LLMaJ for generating textual feedback, and conducts discovery of recurring issues via Key Points Analysis (KPA) \cite{bar-haim-etal-2020-arguments}.
